ic phases, e.g. `--steps 1,3` or `--steps 1-3` |\n| `--no-color` | Disable colored output |\n\n### Key Config Paths (runtime)\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `~/.config/linux_post_install/compose.env` | Global Docker Compose defaults (TS_AUTHKEY, TZ, DNS_SERVER, SERVICES_BASE) |\n| `/usr/local/share/linux_post_install/scale-tail/services/` | ScaleTail template directory |\n| `/srv/<service>/` | Per-service deployment directory (configurable via `SERVICES_BASE`) |\n| `~/.local/share/linux_post_install/logs/` | Command logs |\n| `~/.bashrc` | Modified by postinstall to add PATH and bash completion |\n| `~/.ssh/authorized_keys` | SSH keys installed from `config/authorized_keys` |\n| `~/.config/rclone/rclone.conf` | rclone config (if `config/rclone.conf` exists) |\n\n### Global Compose Config Keys\n\n| Key | Required | Default | Purpose |\n|-----|----------|---------|---------|\n| `TS_AUTHKEY` | Yes | -- | Tailscale auth key for sidecar networking |\n| `TZ` | No | `Europe/Amsterdam` | Timezone for services |\n| `DNS_SERVER` | No | `9.9.9.9` | Custom DNS server |\n| `SERVICES_BASE` | No | `/srv` | Root directory for all deployments |\n\n### Config Cascade (Three Layers for Docker Compose)\n\n```\n1. Template .env          (per-service defaults from ScaleTail, read-only)\n        ↓\n2. Global config          (~/.config/linux_post_install/compose.env, user-edited)\n        ↓\n3. Per-service .env       (/srv/<service>/.env -- created on first deploy, NEVER overwritten)\n```\n\n### System Packages Installed by `preinstall.sh`\n\n`git curl wget vim nano tmux tree jq unzip zip rsync htop btop telnet net-tools iputils-ping traceroute tcpdump nmap openssh-client openssh-server ufw fail2ban ca-certificates gnupg lsb-release python3 python3-pip rclone` (25 packages) + yt-dlp.\n\n### systemd Services\n\n| Service | File | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| `ssh-agent.service` | `systemd/ssh-agent.service` | System-wide SSH agent, socket at `/run/ssh-agent/socke